/*! Truecopy — base & component styles (desktop/base only).
    All media queries live in css/responsive.css.

    STRUCTURE — one block per page, keyed off a page class on <html>.
    These pages were built as forks of one another: the same class can carry different
    values on different pages, and the pages declare their rules in different orders.
    Because equal-specificity rules are resolved by source order, one shared ordering
    cannot reproduce all eleven pages. Each page therefore keeps its own rule order in
    its own block, scoped with :where(), which contributes NO specificity — so within a
    page the cascade is byte-identical to the original.

    Shared @font-face and @keyframes are emitted once, at the top. */

